@startuml Univmar_Overview
title Univmar V1 — Domain Overview
left to right direction

skinparam dpi 170
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 34
skinparam ranksep 42
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageTitleAlignment center

skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #64748B
  ArrowColor #64748B
  FontColor #0F172A
}

skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #0F172A
}

hide methods
hide empty members


rectangle "Website Lead" as Lead
rectangle "Customer" as Customer
rectangle "Catalog" as Catalog
rectangle "RFQ" as RFQ
rectangle "Quotation" as Quotation
rectangle "Order" as Order
rectangle "Inventory" as Inventory
rectangle "Identity & Audit" as Identity

Lead --> Customer : qualify / convert
Lead --> RFQ : convert
Customer --> RFQ : submits
Catalog --> RFQ : requested variants
RFQ --> Quotation : priced offer
Catalog --> Quotation : material lines
Quotation --> Order : accepted
Catalog --> Order : material snapshot
Order --> Inventory : reserve / issue
Identity ..> Customer : portal account
Identity ..> RFQ : uploader / audit
Identity ..> Order : audit
@enduml
